     4297         if error-status:error then do:     run ref/gdsrepos.p (input 1,                    input g-cond,                    input g-list,                    input g-stat,                    input flt-rec,                    output g#log,                    output contin).     if g#log then do:       run full-sch.       return error.     end.   end.   apply "VALUE-changed" to br-gds in frame d-gob-doc-ref.
